Eventually add this to README, but get check what actually work:
FOR XMTP BUILD:
Use Rust Nightly Version June 2026 (whatever older version is needed)
build in xmtp-ffi
then run regenerate for xmtp-sys


When FFI gets recreated, it goes into target. The block below replaces release xmtp_ffi.lib into xmtp_ffi

$src = "D:\RustCode\xmtp\xmtp-ffi\target\release\xmtp_ffi.lib"
$dst = "D:\RustCode\xmtp\xmtp-ffi\xmtp_ffi.lib"
Get-Item $src, $dst | Select-Object FullName, Length, LastWriteTime

FullName                                                 Length LastWriteTime
--------                                                 ------ -------------
D:\RustCode\xmtp\xmtp-ffi\target\release\xmtp_ffi.lib 315762226 10/28/2026 10:24:17 PM
D:\RustCode\xmtp\xmtp-ffi\xmtp_ffi.lib                315597720 10/8/2026 12:12:44 AM


PS D:\RustCode\cliqu3-dioxus> Copy-Item $src $dst -Force

If that doesnt work sometimes cargo clean on xmtp-sys doesnt work properly so remove all xmtp-sys files in these locations:
D:\RustCode\cliqu3-dioxus\target\x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\desktop-dev\deps\libxmtp_sys-*
D:\RustCode\cliqu3-dioxus\target\x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\desktop-dev\.fingerprint\xmtp-sys-*
D:\RustCode\cliqu3-dioxus\target\x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\desktop-dev\build\xmtp-sys-*
